  "solution": "（1）\\(2x ^ { 2 } -4x+2\\)\n=\\(2(x ^ { 2 } -2x+1)\\)\n=\\(2(x-1) ^ { 2 }\\)；\n（2）\\((x-y) ^ { 3 } -16(x-y)\\)\n=\\((x-y)\\left[ (x-y) ^ { 2 } -4 ^ { 2 } \\right]\\)\n=\\((x-y)(x-y+4)(x-y-4)\\)．",
  "solution_steps": [
